# Error Handling

- Use project exceptions from `exceptions.py`: `CashStraException`, `QuestradeException`, `TradingException`, `StrategyException`, `ConfigurationException`, `DatabaseException`
- Avoid bare `except:` or `except Exception:` without re-raising or proper handling
- Prefer specific exception types; chain with `raise ... from e` when appropriate
- Log at appropriate levels before re-raising
